    "notes":  "Helper 1.92: WATCH MODE for when your computer crashes. A switch in Computer Health (Problems page): while it is on, Amit records a reading every 30 seconds to a file on your computer, never overwritten and kept for 14 days. After a hard crash, the next time you sign in Amit packages those readings and Windows\u0027 own log so Computer Health can show what was happening and suggest causes. The Hub also tells you plainly when it notices that Windows crashed, and offers to turn Watch mode on. Nothing leaves your computer unless it crashes.",
